<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO HIGHER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were mixed at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The three-mth rate</p>
<p>was unchanged at 3.13 pct.</p>
<p>				    August 12 fix    August 11 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.03 pct	    3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.07 pct	    3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.13 pct	    3.13 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.31 pct	    3.31 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.47 pct	    3.46 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.68 pct	    3.67 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 292, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
